# chat-app

Real-time chat app built with the MERN stack, containerized end-to-end with
Docker Compose. Bidirectional WebSocket communication with JWT auth and Redis
pub/sub for cross-instance message delivery.

Handles concurrent WebSocket connections with Redis pub/sub for cross-instance message delivery.
